    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839930/extras/8bb5120fd9fe8a3325e586104ba79890.avif?t=1731171731\" /></div><br><br><strong>Choose from one of two different car models! Customize it in your own way, then try it on the track!</strong><br><br>You will have the choice between a hundred different pieces. They can change the appearance of your car, but also the performance of the engine and suspension!<br>The car is completely removable, each piece can be replaced, modified or removed! Change the patterns and colors of your car! A large map fully accessible with a track and different stunt ramp to try the performance of your racing car! Not to mention an excellent playlist of music!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839930/extras/26e15474a62ab517512879f034bb4017.webp?t=1731171731\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><br>\u25a0 Two different car models!<br>\u25a0 Very complete system of customization with no less than 100 different pieces!<br>\u25a0 System to change the patterns and color of your car!<br>\u25a0 A large, fully accessible map!<br>\u25a0 A circuit in the middle of the map!<br>\u25a0 A multitude of stunt ramp!<br>\u25a0 Gearbox system and meter in km / h of the car!<br>\u25a0 Good music!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839930/extras/26e15474a62ab517512879f034bb4017.webp?t=1731171731\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839930/extras/8bb5120fd9fe8a3325e586104ba79890.avif?t=1731171731\" /></div><br><br><strong>Choose from one of two different car models! Customize it in your own way, then try it on the track!</strong><br><br>You will have the choice between a hundred different pieces. They can change the appearance of your car, but also the performance of the engine and suspension!<br>The car is completely removable, each piece can be replaced, modified or removed! Change the patterns and colors of your car! A large map fully accessible with a track and different stunt ramp to try the performance of your racing car! Not to mention an excellent playlist of music!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839930/extras/26e15474a62ab517512879f034bb4017.webp?t=1731171731\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><br>\u25a0 Two different car models!<br>\u25a0 Very complete system of customization with no less than 100 different pieces!<br>\u25a0 System to change the patterns and color of your car!<br>\u25a0 A large, fully accessible map!<br>\u25a0 A circuit in the middle of the map!<br>\u25a0 A multitude of stunt ramp!<br>\u25a0 Gearbox system and meter in km / h of the car!<br>\u25a0 Good music!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/839930/extras/26e15474a62ab517512879f034bb4017.webp?t=1731171731\" /></div>",
